Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.66,0:00:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like no one in Koichi's\Nfamily knows where he went either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from the sound of things,\Nthey're close to calling the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, so he really is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukako is nowhere to be seen either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like it's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.09,0:00:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't think she snapped\Nand snuffed him out, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's come to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless, she's holding him captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we need to\Nfind him and do it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like we don't have much time\Nleft if we want to find him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening to me!
