Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.61,0:00:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure there was a\Nmovie that has the answer I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I never ended up watching it\Nbecause it looked way too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I've almost got this\Nridiculous thing figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, and then four, zero, zero, open!
