Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.82,0:02:25.29,Title Part 4,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(654,590)\pos(139,880)\fs60}Episode 9: {\fs80} Yamagishi Yukako Falls in Love, Part 2
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.82,0:02:25.29,Title Part 4,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(654,590)\pos(139,880)\fs60}Episode 9: {\fs80} Yamagishi Yukako Falls in Love Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.90,0:02:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I washed your pajama bottoms,\Nas well as your underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help if I don't know what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.82,0:02:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that I'm a\Nfreshman in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I let this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be embarrassed if I didn't already\Nfeel like a pathetic waste of a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.78,0:02:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, surely you must despise me by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't I disgust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you please just let me go home now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.82,0:03:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could you possibly like about\Na guy who just peed his pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.76,0:03:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, you poor pitiful thing. How awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must be putting your gentle\Nheart through so much agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm such a bad girl,\Nthe lowest of the low.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing I say has any effect on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.34,0:03:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First I wet myself, now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was watching when you\Ntalked about being a pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,human being and saw a sparkle\Ndeep behind your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I saw in that moment\Nwas positively intoxicating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I didn't know any better, I'd swear\Nyou were hiding an ace up your sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I'm being honest, it\Nmakes me like you even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the reason I want to\Nlearn everything about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.82,0:03:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's a little bit of poop and snot when\Nyou're madly in love with your soulmate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.36,0:03:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you were worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Washing your soiled unmentionables filled
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me with a kind of joy\Nthat I'd never known.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.84,0:04:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm making an electric chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With any luck, it'll be ready\Nfor our dinner time studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about trying out\Na new Italian recipe tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I have to stock up on olive oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's going further and\Nfurther off the deep end!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get out of here faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's seriously going to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How exactly do I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might be completely wrong about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.66,0:05:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even if someone's found\Na way to keep Koichi quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.32,0:05:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can he still call out\Nfor help using Reverb?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ideally, yes, but Reverb only\Nhas a range of about 50 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.30,0:05:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he was taken somewhere isolated,\Nhis powers would be no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.76,0:05:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like looking for\Na needle in a haystack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said something about\Nstocking up on more olive oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she wouldn't go shopping at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's doing a phone order?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is! A payphone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm 48 meters away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's just within range!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness Reverb is a soundstand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.64,0:05:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can signal Josuke and get some help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any 10 yen coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:05:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,planes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.95,0:06:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was in my pajamas\Nwhen I was dragged here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I just dial 110?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I do that, she might\Nkill the officers! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to find some\Nother way to contact Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were wondering whether there was a\Npayphone nearby, weren't you, Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukako!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to pretend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.68,0:06:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know precisely what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I told you that I was\Ngoing to go buy some olive oil,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you thought there must\Nbe a payphone nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.24,0:06:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it needed 10 yen coins,\Nwhich you don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that about cover it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a payphone? How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feigning ignorance?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.20,0:06:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give up on the notion of\Ncalling someone for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not taking a single step\Noutside this house until I say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But so you won't be tempted, I'm going\Nto destroy the phone's emergency button.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.86,0:06:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just no reasoning with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.84,0:07:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My last shot at getting help.
