Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The phone's calling someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never dialed a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higashikata speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got through!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.40,0:07:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the right signals are transmitted,\Na push-button phone will connect!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.86,0:07:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.77,0:07:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.74,0:07:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear waves crashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.81,0:07:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I was right, you do\Nhave a power like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.94,0:07:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Chosuke's gonna rush over\Nhere and rescue me for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.80,0:08:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take 20 minutes tops by car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to figure out a way to\Nhold out until they can get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A payphone and the sound of waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only place Koichi\Ncould be is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.56,0:08:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.82,0:08:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's coming back to the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I have no choice but to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open this door, Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want in so bad, why\Ndon't you break it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A broken door will definitely\Nmake Josuke stop and take notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've made me very happy, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:08:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Discovering you have\Npowers like I do is the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.02,0:09:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most wonderful surprise\NI could have received.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I have to say I'm a bit\Nirritated that you kept this a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.74,0:09:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, I'm happy you're like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because when a man and a woman decide to\Nspend the rest of their lives together,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing is more important than\Na relationship built on love,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trust, and shared values, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.12,0:09:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of us share something no one else\Ncould ever dream of having think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could be the perfect couple
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please Koichi open the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I say open the door\Nopen the goddamn door!
