Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't at all like\Nwhat happened with Tamami.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.12,0:10:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her delusions are too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I didn't think it'd be\Ncompletely useless on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.34,0:10:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally found the one person I'm\Nbound to with the red thread of fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.30,0:10:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I won't let anything come between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some people never find their soulmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand how lucky we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Koichi, my plan was to turn\Nyou into an outstanding man,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but recent events have\Nforced me to change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.82,0:10:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So until you fall madly in love with\Nme, you will remain in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And make no mistake, you\Nare going to love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.44,0:11:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might murder you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.82,0:11:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let her in here, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to land one\Nmore attack with Reverb!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.12,0:11:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I go all out, I'll be able\Nto unleash an even louder sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverb!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong with Reverb.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, what's happening to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.68,0:11:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he collapse because he sensed\Nthat our situation is hopeless?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,REVERB IS DEAD!
