Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.14,0:11:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Reverb.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been turned into a\Nlifeless husk! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.22,0:12:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stanza manifestation of the soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means I must have\Npushed mine too far past
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its breaking point and\Ncollapsed under the pressure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.36,0:12:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean for this to happen, Reverb!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.90,0:12:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.70,0:12:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did he call that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.08,0:12:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, I have to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get this thing out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.62,0:12:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that psycho makes it through the door\Nand catches me, I'm as good as dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, open this door!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to stop her from\Ngetting in here somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only there was a way for\Nthat door to blow her far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It broke out of its shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer the damn question, Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:12:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you put that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.02,0:13:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it! It's reverb!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been changing into a\Nnew form while it was in that shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.78,0:13:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its design hasn't really changed at\Nall, besides the fact that it shrunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless, changing\Nshape isn't going to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, it's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's this wind coming from?
