Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.46,0:14:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right before it happened,\NI wish the door would open.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blow her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize it, but I was\Ncontrolling that sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the brand
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,new Reverb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.93,0:14:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverb Act Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.82,0:14:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This vacation spot is the one place I know
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's by the sea and\Nhas lots of empty houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's great and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there are still tons\Nof houses around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.06,0:14:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we find out which one he's in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By finding the phone booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.52,0:14:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi did call us using\Na public phone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.40,0:14:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we find that booth, we'll start\Nsearching the nearby houses one by one. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.92,0:14:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Search around all you want, sweet,\Nadorable Koichi belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never let anyone else have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I strongly suggest you\Nkeep your distance, Yukako.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.96,0:15:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you should believe me when I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just no way that\Nyour powers can compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with Rebervac 2's new abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our days of playing house are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now my left eyelid is twitching.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.46,0:15:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I was a kid, getting upset\Nalways set off my orbicularis oculi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.58,0:15:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like a weird chick that\Nsaid I was about to get violent!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one stupid little modification\Ndoesn't suddenly make you a big shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to get a little rough now!
