Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.72,0:15:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.32,0:15:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, you shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You earned my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you said you were\Ngonna get a little rough,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you\Nmeant your vulgar mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.26,0:15:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you do this after all I've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You piss-sweating shrimp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.26,0:16:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You belong to me, yet you dare defy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.10,0:16:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I own you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.18,0:16:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverb, act two!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.09,0:16:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could be wrong, but it\Nsounded like something broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I think it's that house!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I can't believe she can make\Nher hair grow to this length.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her soul's more powerful than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.66,0:16:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's a dark and vindictive soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So its name is Reverb. Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've figured out the\Nsecret behind your trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.24,0:16:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is avoid\Ntouching that writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'll ask you this one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You love me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd advise against saying no\Nif you want to keep living.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.98,0:16:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm completely prepared to tear down\Nthis house and bury you in the wreckage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you die, you'll\Nbe mine for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll remain in my heart as a\Npersonal memory of love everlasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to answer the question!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.98,0:17:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have, but you refused to listen, which\Nis how I got wrapped up in this whole mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now, for the upteenth time, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead, Koichi!
