Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.69,0:17:30.73,SFXBlue33,16.3,0,0,0,,{=82}{\fade(255,0,255,-1040,-1040,-150,50)\fry358\pos(1002.26,227.47)\frz351}Kaboom
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening to what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I have this new power,\Nyou can't hold me hostage anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're touching the writing\Nthat's gonna blow you away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad for a pants-wetting\Nlittle shrimp, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, why did her hair turn white?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.56,0:18:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not dead, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, she's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She might be a deranged, love-obsessed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.16,0:18:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,matted mess of a she-devil,\Nbut I guess I should be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to keep hold\Nof you with my loving heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I think I'll destroy your\Nprecious standard consolation!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You disrespecful heart-taker!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even as beaten up as she is,\Nshe's still able to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her will is scary and tense!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not another word!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intense? Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You panty-wetting douche!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you even speak when\Nyou're the one who did this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rejected my love,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blasted me with your stand, and\Nmade my treasured hair turn white?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.74,0:18:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pathetic little jerk-off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.92,0:18:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I loved you with every fiber of my being,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I refuse to let you get away\Nwith doing this to my gorgeous hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're my soulmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.26,0:19:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one gets to undermine my beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna yank off your piss-soaked prick,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.64,0:19:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rip out your insides, and feed him to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as you choke on my merciless love!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, no words!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to get what's coming to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that sound just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukako, you gotta let go of my stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab ahold of something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cliff is about to crumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.76,0:19:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Reverb was listening\Nfor your heartbeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it also heard the ground\Nslowly splitting underneath us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.86,0:19:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try bullshitting me to save\Nyourself from your punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to let go, so I can\Ngrab onto something else! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.12,0:19:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time!
