Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.68,0:20:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you the ground would crumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.16,0:20:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, you've proven time and again\Nthat nothing I say to you sinks in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you'd already placed it there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So while I was in a frenzy\Ntrying to rip Reverb to pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were using your stand to write\Non that rock beneath the cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.10,0:20:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire time I was thinking\Nof how to kill Koichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was focusing all of his energy\Non how to save me from myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He completely defeated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.74,0:20:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if I'm being honest with myself,\NI lost the moment I met Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koichi, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you still in one place?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.06,0:21:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not hurt, are you, Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke and Okuyasu, you guys found me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What took you two so long to get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.28,0:21:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, I think I'm even\Nmore in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.96,0:21:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if he ignores\Nme for the rest of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.82,0:21:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just thinking about him fills me with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.38,0:21:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.94,0:21:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Yukako?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.40,0:21:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her hair has turned completely white!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.18,0:21:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No idea, but look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way she's smiling, you'd\Nthink she was on top of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she's looking over here! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.42,0:21:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.82,0:21:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.92,0:21:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Selfie Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's every man for himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.52,0:21:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be a seagull's beak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.20,0:21:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not allowed to have a drink.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.58,0:22:11.10,Episode 9 Typesetting 2,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(237,1)\pos(460,632)}Morioh Landmark #2
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.58,0:22:11.10,Episode 9 Typesetting 2a,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(237,1)\pos(910,722)}Boing-Boing Cape:\N Location: Ask any local fisherman where \N"Boing-Boing Cape" is, and they'll gladly\Ntake you there by boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.42,0:21:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cape Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.72,0:22:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After apparently witnessing a\Nyoung woman jump to her death?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.72,0:22:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only to bounce off the rocks\Nbelow with a gentle Bang,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.78,0:22:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a pair of fishermen\Ncreated an urban legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.16,0:22:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a new appellation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hirose, I can tell you really\Ngave it your all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.00,0:22:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get scores like that when you study.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.16,0:22:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.86,0:22:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how I should feel about this.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.93,0:22:52.30,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.30,0:22:54.56,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.56,0:22:57.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.35,0:22:59.02,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.02,0:23:01.40,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.40,0:23:03.77,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.77,0:23:06.57,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.57,0:23:08.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.28,0:23:10.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.85,0:23:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come stand a little bit closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher.
